      <h1>How to Choose a Custom T-Shirt Manufacturer: A Buyer's Decision Guide</h1>
      <p class="ar-meta">
        <span>By <strong rel="author">YAUUM Sourcing Team</strong></span>
        <span>Published <time datetime="2026-10-12">October 12, 2026</time></span>
      <span class="ar-views" data-views-for="/custom-t-shirt-manufacturer-guide/" data-views-hit></span>
      </p>
      <p class="ar-lede">Sourcing a custom T-shirt manufacturer is a risk decision, not a purchasing task. The factory you pick sets your landed cost, decides whether your reorder in six months matches the first run, and determines whether a size M actually fits the customers you sold to. Get it wrong and you absorb the loss quietly, order after order</p>
    </div>
